    "summary": "**[Divine Intervention](vsdata:ability/adepta-sororitas.hallowed-martyrs.divine-intervention)** can select 1 of your newly destroyed ADEPTA SORORITAS CHARACTER models. At phase end, return it unengaged at the nearest possible spot to its point of destruction. It forms a separate unit with Starting Strength 1 and returns with D3 wounds. You may spend between 1 and 3 Miracle Dice by discarding them. Each adds 1 to the roll, up to the model’s original wounds.",
